    "description": {
      "value": "You examine the time stream in a particular area, then proceed to stick a few metaphorical pins into it, thickening and slowing down the flow of time until it rumbles along like a river of molasses. Any creature that begins its turn in the area must attempt a Will save.\n\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is slowed 1 this turn.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is slowed 2 this turn."
